he median per issue counts every finished issue, with a zero where the role did not work, so a bar that most issues skip reads a median of 0.\",\"guard\":\"The count `issues` says how many issues hold hours on each bar.\"},{\"mode\":\"Each hour goes to one segment only, by a fixed order, so an hour in a turn while CI runs counts as in a turn.\",\"guard\":\"The code writes the order once, and every bar uses it.\"},{\"mode\":\"The idle segment is the hours that no other segment claimed, which is not idle time by role.\",\"guard\":\"legion-idle-time reads the roles' own claim states.\"}],\"unit\":\"hours\",\"direction\":\"lower_better\",\"kind\":\"legion\",\"source\":\"computed:legion/metrics.FoldPhaseTime\",\"doc_block\":\"2bb44911-4bee-46c0-b10b-eeb524d98ac6\",\"target\":null,\"target_inclusive\":false,\"target_judges\":[],\"owner_role\":\"\",\"person\":\"\",\"issue_key\":\"\",\"state\":\"active\",\"replaced_by\":\"\",\"links\":[],\"written_via\":\"seed\",\"written_by\":{\"kind\":\"system\",\"id\":\"eval-registry\"},\"created_at\":\"2026-11-28T11:07:14.517367Z\",\"answer\":\"\"},\"owner\":{\"role\":\"\",\"person\":\"\",\"written_by\":{\"kind\":\"system\",\"id\":\"eval-registry\"}},\"series\":[{\"eval_id\":\"ACME/legion-phase-time\",\"series\":\"architect\",\"version\":1,\"unit\":\"hours\",\"role\":\"headline\",\"is_primary\":false,\"listed\":true,\"agg\":\"quantile\",\"links\":[],\"min_n\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-28T11:07:14.517367Z\",\"window\":{\"ci_wait\":null,\"hours\":null,\"idle\":null,\"idle_share\":null,\"in_a_turn\":null,\"issues\":null,\"median_per_issue\":null,\"n\":null,\"waiting_on_children\":null,\"waiting_on_person\":null},\"compare\":{\"ci_wait\":null,\"hours\":null,\"idle\":null,\"idle_share\":null,\"in_a_turn\":null,\"issues\":null,\"median_per_issue\":null,\"n\":null,\"waiting_on_children\":null,\"waiting_on_person\":null},\"change\":{\"ci_wait\":null,\"hours\":null,\"idle\":null,\"idle_share\":null,\"in_a_turn\":null,\"issues\":null,\"median